\name{cellucid_camera_set}
\alias{cellucid_camera_set}
\title{Place the camera}
\usage{
cellucid_camera_set(viewer, view, camera)
}
\arguments{
\item{viewer}{A viewer \code{\link{cellucid_view}()} or \code{\link{cellucid_serve}()} returned.}
\item{view}{A view: "View N" as the Compare views list numbers its rows (the live view is View 1 while it is shown, the kept views follow in the order they were kept). Text. Required.}
\item{camera}{A camera: its navigation mode, and its orbit and free-fly poses (the one the mode drives is used). A named list. Required. \describe{\item{\code{freefly}}{A named list. Required. \describe{\item{\code{pitch}}{A number. Required.}\item{\code{position}}{A vector or list of a number (at least 3 items, at most 3 items). Required.}\item{\code{yaw}}{A number. Required.}}}\item{\code{navigationMode}}{"orbit", "planar" or "free" (free-fly). One of \code{"orbit"}, \code{"planar"}, \code{"free"}. Required.}\item{\code{orbit}}{A named list. Required. \describe{\item{\code{phi}}{A number. Required.}\item{\code{radius}}{A number (more than 0). Required.}\item{\code{target}}{A vector or list of a number (at least 3 items, at most 3 items). Required.}\item{\code{targetRadius}}{A number (more than 0). Required.}\item{\code{theta}}{A number. Required.}}}}}
}
\value{
A \code{cellucid_action_request}, at once and invisibly: the action is sent now, or when the viewer's channel opens.
\code{\link{cellucid_action_result}(request)} returns its outcome (what it did, as names, counts and ids), or \code{NULL} when it had nothing to report; \code{request$step} is the history step it made.
}
\description{
Set the camera of a view (views with linked cameras follow); a camera gesture records one of these.
}
\details{
The viewer's action \code{camera.set} (Camera). It changes what the viewer shows: one step of the viewer's history, labelled as R's, undone like any other. The state it can change: \code{camera}.
}
\seealso{
\code{\link{cellucid_act}()} sends any action by its type, and \code{\link{cellucid_action_result}()}
collects its answer.
}
\examples{
if (interactive() && requireNamespace("SeuratObject", quietly = TRUE)) {
  data("pbmc_small", package = "SeuratObject")
  viewer <- cellucid_view(SeuratObject::UpdateSeuratObject(pbmc_small))
  request <- cellucid_camera_set(viewer, camera = list(freefly = list(pitch = 0,
      position = c(0, 0, 0), yaw = 0), navigationMode = "orbit",
      orbit = list(phi = 0, radius = 1, target = c(0,
          0, 0), targetRadius = 1, theta = 0)), view = "View 1")
  print(request)
  # cellucid_action_result(request) waits for its outcome.
  cellucid_stop(viewer)
}
}
